       "description": "RYOBI introduces the 18V ONE+ HP Compact Brushless 2-Tool Combo Kit. This next generation of HP compact brushless tools utilizes ONE+ HP Brushless technology to deliver more power, longer runtime, and longer motor life. At a length of just 5.2\" in length, this Impact Driver is the most compact and lightest weight RYOBI Impact Driver, making it ideal for working in tight spots and completing overhead applications without strain. The brushless motor delivers up to 1,900 in-lbs. of torque-and up to 3,900 IPM to quickly drive a variety of fasteners. The Drill/Driver, measuring at 6.1\" delivers 450 in-lbs. of torque for maximum power when drilling and driving through tough materials. Additional features include a two-speed gearbox (0-450 and 0-1,700 RPM) and a 24-position clutch for maximum control while drilling and driving. The 1/2 in. single sleeve ratcheting chuck is custom designed with a unique knurling pattern to provide a durable grip for quick bit changes. Best of all, it is part of the RYOBI ONE+ System of over 300 Cordless Products that all work on the same battery platform. Backed by the RYOBI 3-Year Manufacturer's Warranty, this ONE+ HP 18V Compact Brushless 2-Tool Combo kit includes (1) PSBDD02 ONE+ HP 18V Compact Brushless Cordless 1/2 in. Drill/Driver, (1) PSBID02 ONE+ HP 18V Compact Brushless 1/4 in. Impact Driver, (2) Compact Lithium Battery, Charger, Tool Bag and Operator's manuals.",
